description:
Cross-venue perp funding divergence for one asset — the basis/carry read, not the raw rates. Reads Binance, Bybit, OKX, Gate.io, Bitget, Hyperliquid, dYdX, MEXC and KuCoin in parallel, normalises every rate to a per-8h figure (hourly venues scaled), and returns the spread (max minus min, cheapest and dearest venue, deviation from the median), its percentile against the last 7 days of cross-venue spreads, a plain-English read, and — given notional_usd — a carry estimate (per 8h / day / 30d) net of an assumed taker fee with the breakeven holding time. Venues that fail to answer are named in venues_unavailable; the spread is computed over the ones that did.

Use when: An agent wants to know whether funding on one venue is out of line with the others for the same perp — to pick the cheaper venue for a position, or to size a long/short carry across venues.
Not for: you only need one venue's current funding — funding_rates is free; you want a trade verdict for one venue — pre_trade_check. This call settles $0.01 on-chain.
Returns: asset, as_of, venues[{venue, rate_8h_pct, rate_annualized_pct, raw_rate_pct, interval_hours, next_funding_time}] sorted cheapest first, spread{pct_8h, bps_8h, annualized_pct, median_8h_pct, max_deviation_from_median_pct, cheapest, dearest}, history{days, buckets, spread_pct_8h_p50/p90/max, current_percentile}, carry_estimate{per_8h_usd, per_day_usd, per_30d_usd, taker_fees_round_trip_usd, breakeven_hours, assumptions} | null, read, venues_unavailable{venue: reason}
Example response: {"asset":"ETH","as_of":"2026-11-05T12:41:00+00:00","venues":[{"venue":"okx","rate_8h_pct":0.01,"rate_annualized_pct":10.95,"raw_rate_pct":0.01,"interval_hours":8,"next_funding_time":1793923200000},{"venue":"hyperliquid","rate_8h_pct":0.01,"rate_annualized_pct":10.95,"raw_rate_pct":0.00125,"interval_hours":1,"next_funding_time":1793883600000},{"venue":"dydx","rate_8h_pct":0.039,"rate_annualized_pct":42.7,"raw_rate_pct":0.004875,"interval_hours":1,"next_funding_time":1793883600000}],"spread":{"pct_8h":0.029,"bps_8h":2.9,"annualized_pct":31.75,"median_8h_pct":0.01,"max_deviation_from_median_pct":0.029,"cheapest":"okx","dearest":"dydx"},"history":{"days":7,"buckets":22,"venues_with_history":["dydx","hyperliquid","okx"],"spread_pct_8h_p50":0.0125,"spread_pct_8h_p90":0.04242,"spread_pct_8h_max":0.05698,"current_percentile":77},"carry_estimate":{"notional_usd":10000,"long_on":"okx","short_on":"dydx","per_8h_usd":2.9,"per_day_usd":8.7,"per_30d_usd":261,"taker_fees_round_trip_usd":20,"breakeven_hours":55.2,"assumptions":"taker 0.05% per leg on both venues, open and close; spread held constant; no slippage, no basis move"},"read":"ETH funding 0.0390%/8h on dydx vs 0.0100% on okx — 2.9 bps/8h, 77th percentile of the last 7 days (7 of 9 venues answered)","venues_unavailable":{"binance":"geo-blocked (451)","bybit":"geo-blocked (403)"}}

Price: $0.01 USDC per call (x402 over MCP: an unpaid call returns PaymentRequired; pay via _meta x402/payment)
